# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  SECRETS — never commit these. If one slips through, rotating the
#  key is the only real fix; deleting the commit is not enough,
#  because GitHub keeps unreachable objects and forks retain them.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
